  "body": "Set on a generous 619sqm section with approximately 239sqm of floor area, this home features five bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas, with a flexible layout that works beautifully for growing families, extended family living or those needing extra space to work from home.\r\n\r\n• 5 spacious bedrooms and 3 modern bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• 3 separate living areas\r\n• Approx. 239sqm floor area on a 619sqm section\r\n• Granny potential with 2 bedrooms, a bathroom and a separate living area\r\n• Stylish designer kitchen with a large island bench\r\n• Walk-in scullery for extra storage and preparation space\r\n• Two outdoor entertaining areas\r\n• Central air conditioning unit for year-round comfort\r\n• 10-year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocated in Millwater, you are part of a family-friendly community. Local schools, parks, and cafes are all within easy reach, with easy access to the motorway.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
